        {"source": "spec", "quote": "The specification identifies the board as an ATtiny-driven fan controller but does not state a nonstandard ISP pinout."}
      ],
      "impact": "An ISP programmer would drive SCK into the MCU reset pin and assert reset into the MCU SCK pin, preventing normal in-system programming and possibly holding the MCU in an undefined/reset state.",
